{"seq":1,"slug":"concepts-and-classification","title":"高分子概念与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/foundations/concepts-and-classification","wordCount":1437,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高分子概念与分类\">高分子概念与分类</h1><p>一根聚乙烯分子的化学式可以写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-(CH_2-CH_2)_n-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 动辄上万。这个朴素的式子藏着高分子区别于小分子的全部秘密：它不是某个确定大小的分子，而是同一个结构片段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-CH_2-CH_2-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 被共价键串联重复了非常多次的产物。理解高分子，第一步就是学会拆解并命名这种「重复」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构成高分子的基本砖块叫<strong>单体</strong>（monomer），是能参与聚合反应的小分子，如乙烯、苯乙烯、己二酸。聚合后在链上不断重复出现的最小结构单位叫<strong>重复单元</strong>（repeat unit）或结构单元；它与单体未必完全相同——加聚时两者组成一致，缩聚时重复单元会少掉小分子（如水）。一条链里重复单元的个数叫<strong>聚合度</strong>（degree of polymerization，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>），它与分子量的关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = DP \\times M_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重复单元的摩尔质量。</p>\n<p>按链上单体种类，只含一种重复单元的叫<strong>均聚物</strong>（homopolymer），含两种及以上的叫<strong>共聚物</strong>（copolymer）——共聚物的序列排布（无规、交替、嵌段、接枝）是设计性能的强力杠杆，其合成机理在<a href=\"../polymerization/copolymerization-controlled-radical\">共聚与可控自由基聚合</a>中详述。</p>\n<p>下图勾勒从单体到不同链拓扑的生成路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[单体&lt;br/&gt;monomer] --&gt; B[聚合反应]&#10;  B --&gt; C[线型链&lt;br/&gt;linear]&#10;  B --&gt; D[支化链&lt;br/&gt;branched]&#10;  B --&gt; E[交联网络&lt;br/&gt;crosslinked]&#10;  C --&gt; F[热塑性&lt;br/&gt;可反复熔融]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[热固性&lt;br/&gt;不可再熔]\">flowchart TD\n  A[单体&lt;br/&gt;monomer] --&gt; B[聚合反应]\n  B --&gt; C[线型链&lt;br/&gt;linear]\n  B --&gt; D[支化链&lt;br/&gt;branched]\n  B --&gt; E[交联网络&lt;br/&gt;crosslinked]\n  C --&gt; F[热塑性&lt;br/&gt;可反复熔融]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[热固性&lt;br/&gt;不可再熔]</pre><p>不同分类维度并非互斥，而是从不同角度切同一个对象。下表汇总三条最常用的分类轴：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类维度</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>典型实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>天然 / 合成</td>\n<td>是否人工合成</td>\n<td>纤维素、蛋白质 / 聚乙烯、尼龙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链拓扑</td>\n<td>线型 / 支化 / 交联</td>\n<td>链的连接几何</td>\n<td>HDPE / LDPE / 硫化橡胶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热行为</td>\n<td>热塑性 / 热固性</td>\n<td>加热能否再熔</td>\n<td>PP、PET / 环氧、酚醛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主链元素</td>\n<td>碳链 / 杂链 / 元素有机</td>\n<td>主链是否含杂原子</td>\n<td>聚苯乙烯 / 聚酯 / 硅橡胶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重复单元与聚合度-链有多长才算-高分子\">重复单元与聚合度：链有多长才算「高分子」</h2><p>并非任何重复都构成高分子。一般以分子量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为界，低于此称低聚物（oligomer）。这个门槛不是随意定的：当链足够长时，链与链之间的缠结（entanglement）开始主导力学行为，材料才表现出韧性、成膜性、橡胶弹性等只有大分子才有的性质。一段仅含十几个乙烯单元的「聚乙烯」是石蜡般的软蜡，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 上万的同种物质却是能做成防弹板的工程材料——化学组成完全相同，差别只在链长。</p>\n<p>聚合度本身是个统计量，因为一批链长短不一，所以谈聚合度通常指其平均值，这正引出下一篇<a href=\"molecular-weight-distribution\">分子量与分子量分布</a>要量化的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按链拓扑分类-线型-支化与交联\">按链拓扑分类：线型、支化与交联</h2><p>链的连接几何深刻影响堆砌与流动能力。<strong>线型</strong>链像一根根毛线，能较规整地靠拢，故高密度聚乙烯（HDPE）密度高、结晶度高、较硬。<strong>支化</strong>链带有侧枝，妨碍紧密堆砌，故低密度聚乙烯（LDPE）密度低、更软更透明。<strong>交联</strong>则把链与链用化学键钉死成三维网络：轻度交联的天然橡胶硫化后获得回弹性，高度交联的环氧树脂则成为坚硬不熔的热固性材料。</p>\n<p>这条轴直接对应热行为：线型/支化链受热可解开缠结而流动，属热塑性，可反复加工与回收；而交联网络受热只会分解不会流动，属热固性，这也使其回收远比热塑性困难——这是<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/degradable-circular-polymers\">可降解与循环高分子</a>要面对的核心难题之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按热行为与聚集态分类\">按热行为与聚集态分类</h2><p>热塑性与热固性的划分关乎能否循环再生，是产业层面最要紧的二分。热塑性高分子加热软化、冷却变硬，过程可逆，PE、PP、PVC、PET 等通用塑料都属此类，占塑料产量的绝大部分。热固性高分子在固化时形成不可逆网络，耐热耐溶剂但不能再熔，多用于黏合剂、涂料、复合材料基体。</p>\n<p>此外还可按使用领域粗分为通用塑料、工程塑料与特种高分子，性能与价格逐级递增，这一谱系在<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/engineering-plastics-rubber-fiber\">工程塑料、橡胶与纤维</a>中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"天然高分子与合成高分子\">天然高分子与合成高分子</h2><p>高分子并非人类发明——纤维素、淀粉、蛋白质、天然橡胶、DNA 都是天然大分子，地球生命本身就建立在高分子化学之上。19 世纪人们先是改性天然高分子（如硝化纤维素），20 世纪初施陶丁格（Staudinger）确立「大分子学说」后，全合成高分子才真正爆发。今天合成与天然两条线正在交汇：以生物质为原料的聚乳酸（PLA）、聚羟基脂肪酸酯（PHA）既是合成产物又源于天然，成为可降解材料的主力，详见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/degradable-circular-polymers\">可降解与循环高分子</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>下图把本篇分类坐标收束为一张全景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高分子] --&gt; B[来源&lt;br/&gt;天然/合成]&#10;  A --&gt; C[链拓扑&lt;br/&gt;线型/支化/交联]&#10;  A --&gt; D[热行为&lt;br/&gt;热塑性/热固性]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  A --&gt; E[聚合度 DP&lt;br/&gt;M = DP × M0]&#10;  E --&gt; F[≥10⁴ 才显缠结特性]\">flowchart TD\n  A[高分子] --&gt; B[来源&lt;br/&gt;天然/合成]\n  A --&gt; C[链拓扑&lt;br/&gt;线型/支化/交联]\n  A --&gt; D[热行为&lt;br/&gt;热塑性/热固性]\n  C --&gt; D\n  A --&gt; E[聚合度 DP&lt;br/&gt;M = DP × M0]\n  E --&gt; F[≥10⁴ 才显缠结特性]</pre><ul>\n<li>高分子是单体经聚合形成的长链大分子，由<strong>重复单元</strong>重复<strong>聚合度</strong>次构成，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = DP \\times M_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>分子量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是高分子与低聚物的经验分界，链长够长才出现缠结主导的特征性质。</li>\n<li>三条主分类轴——来源、链拓扑、热行为——从不同角度切同一对象，彼此正交又相互关联。</li>\n<li>链拓扑（线型/支化/交联）几乎直接决定热行为（热塑性/热固性），进而决定可加工性与可回收性。</li>\n<li>这套概念是全 hub 的词典：分子量统计见<a href=\"molecular-weight-distribution\">下一篇</a>，链的空间统计见<a href=\"chain-conformation-statistics\">链构象与统计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高分子概念与分类","id":"高分子概念与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重复单元与聚合度：链有多长才算「高分子」","id":"重复单元与聚合度-链有多长才算-高分子"},{"level":2,"text":"按链拓扑分类：线型、支化与交联","id":"按链拓扑分类-线型-支化与交联"},{"level":2,"text":"按热行为与聚集态分类","id":"按热行为与聚集态分类"},{"level":2,"text":"天然高分子与合成高分子","id":"天然高分子与合成高分子"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"分子量与分子量分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/foundations/molecular-weight-distribution"}}